  "note": "The active 51-entry SP12 r2 series passed two complete ordered replays from the verified signed CachyOS 7.3.1-1 archive; both final source trees have SHA-256 192c5187bca08d67cb167cf7be77996fdde7f4c3717e19bb200775bf48a161fb. The added Vikash Garodia v6 Iris context-bank binding patches restore shared Venus and SM8550 Iris schema coverage for the existing Iris driver and Hamoa DTS changes. Targeted dt_binding_check, YAML lint, fresh SP12 DTB compile, and DTB schema validation passed. A clean full51 package build, refreshed installer media, VM qualification, physical hardware qualification, native ARM64 live-media qualification, and attribution/license/ redistribution review remain open. The pmdomain SS1 pair remains excluded pending a coherent property/schema rebase and SP12 residency evidence; EL2 Iris patches are conditional and do not apply as-is to the 7.3.1 source.",
